//! Purpose:
//! Generated Rust tests for the committed PHP 8.5.8 `ext/simplexml` PHPT corpus.
//!
//! Called from:
//! - `cargo test` through `tests/codegen/simplexml_php_src.rs`.
//!
//! Key details:
//! - Generated by `scripts/gen_php_src_simplexml_cases.py`; do not hand-edit.
//! - Each test carries its PHP source and assertion inline, and the test process
//!   never parses a `.phpt` file at run time.

